ART_WIDGET&quot;'-78c996f122d375acEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GEN_Races_ScandalousCambionPlay</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_Races_ScandalousCambionPlay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_Races_ScandalousCambionPlay\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">eb7cc5b2-40d2-4602-b7f9-21037bbd5c56</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:eb7cc5b2-40d2-4602-b7f9-21037bbd5c56\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:eb7cc5b2-40d2-4602-b7f9-21037bbd5c56\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li>\n<li>In the storage room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Risen_Road_Toll_House\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Risen Road Toll House\">Risen Road Toll House</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-673&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-407</span></li>\n<li>At the <a href=\"/wiki/Risen_Road\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Risen Road\">Risen Road</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;106&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;553</span></li>\n<li>On the First floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Forge_of_the_Nine\" title=\"Forge of the Nine\">Forge of the Nine</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-13&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-3</span></li>\n<li>On a bookshelf in <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Fee\" title=\"Devil's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-20&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;3</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This is an excerpt from the play 'A Pleasurable Deal', banned in no fewer than four cities for its lewd content. Its scandalous nature led to a number of widely-distributed and illicit printings.]\n</p><p><br>\nNarrator:\n</p><p>Come hear fair folk a tale now lost to time.\n</p><p>In grief, this man well-sunk to depths sublime\n</p><p>A gift he sought to win his lady's heart.\n</p><p>Our cambion smiled, for now the game did start.\n</p><p><br>\n[Enter Robert. Male tiefling. Crying. Carlisle, stage right. Flash of smoke.]\n</p><p><br>\nCarlisle:\n</p><p>Weep not, young man, though free your wife has fled,\n</p><p>And comfort found in comrade's arms and bed.\n</p><p>She licks her lips and cries his name, oh my!\n</p><p>And now you seek to be the apple of her eye?\n</p><p><br>\nRobert:\n</p><p>How does a stranger know such things, I ask?\n</p><p><br>\nCarlisle:\n</p><p>I watch you from the shadows and I see\n</p><p>Your shame and grief for nature's malady.\n</p><p>You seek to win your lady and her bed\n</p><p>To have your name upon her lips instead\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Robert:\n</p><p>You know my curse, my pain, my grief, my woe?\n</p><p><br>\nCarlisle:\n</p><p>Of you, I know, you seek a large hoe,\n</p><p>To plow fair maid, and sow a seed to grow,\n</p><p>But lack do ye a mighty horn and mast\n</p><p>With which to guide a maid to bed and fast.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Pleasurable_Deal:_The_Shocking_Truth\" title=\"A Pleasurable Deal: The Shocking Truth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_Pleasurable_Deal:_The_Shocking_Truth\" title=\"A Pleasurable Deal: The Shocking Truth\">A Pleasurable Deal: The Shocking Truth</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202831\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2006/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36287/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13294/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 977801/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.871      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   51.871      1 -total\n 44.02%   22.836      7 Template:Icon_text\n 40.55%   21.031     23 Template:Trim\n 19.88%   10.313      2 Template:Uid\n 14.25%    7.389      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 12.90%    6.691      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.48%    5.955      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.46%    5.946      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.97%    5.692      9 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:7999-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202831 and revision id 396806. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}